rrent challenges, strengths, and goals through culturally sensitive and trauma-informed assessments. We honor your lived experience and how your identity and culture intersect with trauma—you're living—whether related to culture, expectations, family dynamics, or systemic struggles.</p></div><div class="korawells-process__step svelte-1hc439w korawells-process__step--inactive" data-step="2"><h3 class="korawells-process__step-title svelte-1hc439w">COLLABORATIVE GOAL-SETTING</h3> <p class="korawells-process__step-description body-text svelte-1hc439w">We develop clear, personalized objectives that align with you values and aspirations. Whether you're seeking to safely process trauma, navigate identity conflicts, heal from loss, or build resilience, we create a roadmap that feels authentic and actionable for your unique circumstances.</p></div><div class="korawells-process__step svelte-1hc439w korawells-process__step--inactive" data-step="3"><h3 class="korawells-process__step-title svelte-1hc439w">EVIDENCE-BASED INTERVENTION</h3> <p class="korawells-process__step-description body-text svelte-1hc439w">Using flexible, research-backed therapies, approaches tailored to your needs, we begin the active work of healing. This includes trauma-focused techniques like EMDR, mindfulness practices, and LGBTQIA+ affirming practices—all adapted to honor your individual experience.</p></div><div class="korawells-process__step svelte-1hc439w korawells-process__step--inactive" data-step="4"><h3 class="korawells-process__step-title svelte-1hc439w">SKILLS DEVELOPMENT &amp; RESILIENCE</h3> <p class="korawells-process__step-description body-text svelte-1hc439w">We focus on building practical tools for managing anxiety, setting boundaries, regulating emotions, and strengthening your sense of self. You'll learn to grounding and coping skills while staying connected to what matters most to you.</p></div><div class="korawells-process__step svelte-1hc439w korawells-process__step--inactive" data-st